  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "てきに　なめられないよう　がんばって\nにらみつけるが　こうかは　うすい。\nくわえた　はっぱが　トレードマーク。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "적이 얕잡아 보지 못하도록 열심히\n노려보지만, 효과가 약하다.\n물고 있는 잎사귀가 트레이드마크다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il fait son possible pour intimider ses adversaires\navec un regard menaçant, mais sans succès. Il a\nl’habitude de constamment mâcher une feuille.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es starrt den Gegner finster an, um nicht unterschätzt\nzu werden, hat aber nur wenig Erfolg damit.\nDas Kauen auf einem Blatt ist sein Markenzeichen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se esfuerza mucho para que el enemigo no lo\nmenosprecie, pero su mirada no intimida demasiado.\nSe caracteriza por mascar siempre una hoja.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fa di tutto per farsi prendere sul serio dai nemici,\nma il suo sguardo di sfida non è molto efficace.\nHa il vizio di masticare una foglia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It does its best to be taken seriously by its enemies,\nbut its glare is not sufficiently intimidating.\nChewing on a leaf is its trademark.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "敵に　なめられないよう　がんばって\nにらみつけるが　効果は　薄い。\nくわえた　葉っぱが　トレードマーク。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se esfuerza mucho para que el enemigo no lo\nmenosprecie, pero su mirada no intimida demasiado.\nSe caracteriza por mascar siempre una hoja.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いっしょうけんめい　こわい　かおで\nあいてを　にらみつけるが　あたまを\nなでられると　つい　にやけてしまう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "무서운 얼굴로 열심히\n상대를 노려보지만 머리를\n쓰다듬어주면 금방 해죽거린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il fait de son mieux pour avoir un air patibulaire,\nmais il sourit béatement dès qu’on lui caresse la tête.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es gibt alles, um ein finsteres Gesicht zu machen und\nsein Gegenüber böse anzustarren, aber wenn es am\nKopf gestreichelt wird, muss es unwillkürlich grinsen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se desvive tratando de fulminar a su rival con una\nmirada aterradora, pero en cuanto le acarician la\ncabeza, no puede evitar sonreír de oreja a oreja.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce la mette tutta per intimorire i nemici con uno\nsguardo truce, ma appena qualcuno gli accarezza\nla testa, diventa un tenerone.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It does its level best to glare and pull a scary face,\nbut it can’t help grinning if anyone pats its head.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "一生懸命　怖い　顔で　相手を\nにらみつけるが　頭を　なでられると\nつい　にやけてしまう。",
