      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "형님처럼 의지하며 따르는\n부란다의 행동을 따라 하면서\n성장해 간다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "不斷模仿被自己當成老大哥般\n敬仰著的流氓熊貓的舉止，\n由此漸漸變得獨當一面。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il grandit en copiant les poses et les mimiques\nde ce gros cador de Pandarbare, qu’il considère\ncomme son mentor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pandagro ist sein großes Vorbild, das es stets\nnachahmt. Dabei ist es so eifrig, dass es daran\nwächst.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En su afán por madurar, toma como modelo a\nPangoro, hacia el que profesa sumo respeto.\nPara él es como una especie de mentor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aspira a diventare un Pokémon rispettato e\ntemuto imitando Pangoro, che considera il suo\nmentore.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It grows up imitating the behavior of Pangoro,\nwhich it looks up to as a leader.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "親分の　ように　慕っている\nゴロンダの　仕草を　真似ながら\n一人前に　なっていくぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
